Twin-2K-500
  Source:  https://huggingface.co/datasets/LLM-Digital-Twin/Twin-2K-500
  Revision: f883165a3026fde855dfd448e0cd16443ab257b6
  License: CC BY 4.0
  Used:    GPT-4.1-mini simulation outputs and human survey responses from the
           LLM_simulation_results directory. Attribute the dataset authors when
           reusing it or any results derived from it.

GSS replication package ("When Synthetic Users Fail")
  Source:  https://github.com/ZihanChen1995/when-synthetic-users-fail-a-cross-domain-benchmark-of-llm-simulated-human-survey-responses
  Commit:  76aa0376835b60c5dd54851a6fc4e77e32753465
  License: MIT (code), CC BY 4.0 (data), per the package's own LICENSE files.
           Some model outputs inside it (Llama) are additionally subject to the
           Llama 3.x community licenses.
  Used:    General Social Survey pilot sample and LLM runs. The package's World
           Values Survey files are NOT used: their license (WVSA non-profit
           replication only, no redistribution) does not allow it here.
